# Twitch Helix clip auto-fetch (optional — the app works fine without these).
#
# 1. Register an app at https://dev.twitch.tv/console/apps to get a
#    Client ID + Client Secret.
# 2. Find your broadcaster_id via GET /helix/users?login=BingusTheWizard.
#
# VITE_TWITCH_CLIENT_ID is exposed to the client bundle (VITE_ prefix) and is
# only used to detect whether the feature is configured.
# TWITCH_CLIENT_SECRET must remain server-side only — it is read exclusively
# by the Vercel serverless function in /api/clips.ts and must NEVER be given
# a VITE_ prefix.

VITE_TWITCH_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
TWITCH_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret_here
TWITCH_BROADCASTER_ID=your_broadcaster_id_here
